<title>USA: CBOT sets annual trading volume record.</title>
<headline>CBOT sets annual trading volume record.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade said it set an annual trading volume record as of the end of trading Thursday.</p>
<p>Year-to-date trading volume as of the close on December 19 totaled 220,219,672 futures and options contracts, compared to the prior record of 219,504,074 contracts traded in the entire year of 1994, the exchange said.</p>
